              is complete and cocomplete.
          %h3#for_locally_presentable_categories For locally presentable categories
          %p
            If
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi C
