            is also locally presentable and in particular cocomplete. Details may be found in
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Locally+presentable+and+accessible+categories"} Locally presentable and accessible categories
          %h2#algebraic_functors_have_left_adjoints Algebraic functors have left adjoints
          .num_theorem
            %h6#theorem_3 Theorem
            %p
              Suppose that
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
