                      %mi A
                    %mi M
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} B \otimes_A M
              is the coequalizer in
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msup
                      %mi Ab
                      %mi B
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Ab^B
              of
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mrow
                      %mtable
                        %mtr
